# Request collection. Populate tokens only through a private REST-client environment.
# The sample image URLs are served by the loopback fixture plugin, not a public image host.
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8899/wp-json/autoagora-dealer/v1
@accessToken = REPLACE_IN_PRIVATE_ENVIRONMENT
@listingId = 123
@version = "REPLACE_WITH_CURRENT_VERSION"

### Current options and parent makes
GET {{base}}/catalog?page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Own stock
GET {{base}}/listings?page=1&per_page=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create pending stock (use a new external ID and key for a genuinely new car)
POST {{base}}/listings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: sample-create-001

< ./sample-vehicle.json

### Read the current version before updating
GET {{base}}/listings/{{listingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Update price, retaining omitted photos and optional fields
PATCH {{base}}/listings/{{listingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: sample-update-001
If-Match: {{version}}

{"price":13000}

### Withdraw and retain data/media
POST {{base}}/listings/{{listingId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: sample-withdraw-001
If-Match: {{version}}

{"status":"withdrawn"}

### Disconnect the current dealer/partner authorization
DELETE {{base}}/connection
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: sample-disconnect-001
